<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>Welcome to the team, Aisha Noor</title>
<style>
  body { margin:0 !important; padding:0 !important; width:100% !important; }
  a { color:#0B0B0D; }
  @media only screen and (max-width:620px) {
    .hf-card { width:100% !important; }
    .hf-pad { padding-left:24px !important; padding-right:24px !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F3F5F9;color:#1B1F27;">
<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;color:#F3F5F9;">Your access request was approved. Set your password within 48 hours.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="background-color:#F3F5F9;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" class="hf-card" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;">
<tr><td class="hf-pad" style="padding:0 40px 20px 40px;"><span style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;color:#0B0B0D;">HACA FORGE</span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DDE2EB;border-radius:16px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td class="hf-pad" style="padding:36px 40px 20px 40px;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.2px;color:#0B0B0D;">Welcome to the team, Aisha Noor</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F27;color:#586170;">Your access request has been approved by the administrator.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F27;">Click the button below to set your account password and activate your workspace. This single-use link is valid for 48 hours.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#0B0B0D" style="background-color:#0B0B0D;border-radius:8px;"><a href="http://localhost:5173/set-password?token=sample-token" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;background-color:#0B0B0D;">Set Password &amp; Activate Account</a></td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#586170;">If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br><a href="http://localhost:5173/set-password?token=sample-token" target="_blank" style="color:#0B0B0D;text-decoration:underline;word-break:break-all;">http://localhost:5173/set-password?token=sample-token</a></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="hf-pad" style="padding:24px 40px 0 40px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#586170;">
<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#586170;">You&#39;re receiving this because you have a HACA Forge account.</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#586170;">Haris &amp; Co Academy &middot; <a href="http://localhost:5173" target="_blank" style="color:#586170;text-decoration:underline;">localhost:5173</a></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
",
  "subject": "Welcome to HACA Forge - Set Your Password",
  "text": "HACA FORGE

Welcome to the team, Aisha Noor

Your access request has been approved by the administrator.

Click the button below to set your account password and activate your workspace. This single-use link is valid for 48 hours.

Set Password & Activate Account: http://localhost:5173/set-password?token=sample-token

If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:
http://localhost:5173/set-password?token=sample-token

--
You're receiving this because you have a HACA Forge account.
Haris & Co Academy
http://localhost:5173
",
}
`;

