</head>
<body bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F3F5F9;color:#1B1F27;">
<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;color:#F3F5F9;">Set a new password. The link is valid for 48 hours.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="background-color:#F3F5F9;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" class="hf-card" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;">
<tr><td class="hf-pad" style="padding:0 40px 20px 40px;"><span style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;color:#0B0B0D;">HACA FORGE</span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DDE2EB;border-radius:16px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td class="hf-pad" style="padding:36px 40px 20px 40px;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.2px;color:#0B0B0D;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F27;color:#586170;">Hello Mohammed Rafi, a password reset was requested for your account.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F27;">Click the button below to set your password. This single-use link is valid for 48 hours.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#586170;">If you didn&#39;t request this, ignore this email.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#0B0B0D" style="background-color:#0B0B0D;border-radius:8px;"><a href="http://localhost:5173/set-password?token=sample-token" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;background-color:#0B0B0D;">Set Password &amp; Sign In</a></td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#586170;">If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br><a href="http://localhost:5173/set-password?token=sample-token" target="_blank" style="color:#0B0B0D;text-decoration:underline;word-break:break-all;">http://localhost:5173/set-password?token=sample-token</a></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="hf-pad" style="padding:24px 40px 0 40px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#586170;">
<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#586170;">You&#39;re receiving this because you have a HACA Forge account.</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#586170;">Haris &amp; Co Academy &middot; <a href="http://localhost:5173" target="_blank" style="color:#586170;text-decoration:underline;">localhost:5173</a></p>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
",
  "subject": "HACA Forge - Password Reset Request",
  "text": "HACA FORGE

Reset your password

Hello Mohammed Rafi, a password reset was requested for your account.

Click the button below to set your password. This single-use link is valid for 48 hours.

